\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {1}{\ignorespaces UV/VIS absorption spectrum of an aqueous $[\text {Fe}(\text {bipy})_3]\text {Cl}_2$ solution. The different CT transitions are indicated. The measured molar absorptivity $\epsilon $ values lie in the expected range of $10^{-4}\text {\, l}\text {\,mol}^{-1}\text {\,cm}^{-1}$ to $10^{-5}\text {\, l}\text {\,mol}^{-1}\text {\,cm}^{-1}$ for dipole-allowed transitions\cite {0}}}{4}{figure.caption.1}%
